{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1455,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e94295974a27ed6df01f0b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日の貴方のプランは？\r\n受け入れるかは内容次第だけれど…\r\n従わせてくださるの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "98024bb3c5f2f04f656b05541769d632fceac5c93cdfe390046f4caa61af8fa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed0b2d01f2ae85bf6a636dff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "確かな目で、見つめてくださる。\r\n今の私は…完璧かしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e830c6ad64b9df0ed4d4efd3d0c5e67a9320459323f960bce21eba88ad0635be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb40d01d7b51cb0a1e5897a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間よ。\r\n貴方の手で…導いてご覧なさいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ffc8d73482a6fa2bd966cf518a2de19ab141b69eb0473046b0cb59c870bdde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a4eeb255a2cc599c9f32e0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぅ…わざわざ、\r\nより暑いほうを選ぶのね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6165963ddef76d3b5befbb8988b05e31d9bec7c22f8ce300620b2eb48be03885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ca302d148f277a05ae906dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方の愛、頂いたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "febc3fad6cfa52e64f89aee75640bfec7cddbe07ae1e59ed2190e5d158f825c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18257e60f71c29bc66bb817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れさま…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f358c5c7746f8b8bca46e68bd8a34fb14e206d93de37d841f8a09abda6bba7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41a718455b01979a49023300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい気分…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "491e321d1d823e7ce63b18844155873b1b93b447a6f6826cd2c76a4f4965781f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:446efa5470453e1a1a3b8463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧でなくてはね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19a42735777b74b57dd6dea752786c9a3269979f4140c2f1a12f9970af314b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea6674fc5ca35b1b846d14a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メジロラモーヌ、ですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fbf941a38470f4c97822d81c2a0810f2fa8d2fe1ec10eff6f7ca40bf6056531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fea3a815c477ffa2968f654d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧に勝利して、完全を捧げる\r\n愛のために……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e3556df9bfcd21b9ae7c35879dbba8881e41fde674706c1e1e95af69678fc46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b1c3a8d09cccfd06012c40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "需要我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ee76acabfbf452d701ce940a378c46b76300a0d9e606b3d0927b0429c4c854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6b0f4071cb77ea3e5c7680",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要做，我就不会放水哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b483c7fc3c0becb812d1a7063856d3f8ada7e82fc70a5853d30984530d69f8f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725a90ab366e073ecb3d6dcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a54c3e0a4c22fa18eec40b86616d9118dd4aacb049d8ce94a1df739a4dfd66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f98da4904318d9d590c95b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的小真，\r\n请你都要好好看着。\r\n……不可以忘记喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "501562c95368d5d1cc62e0daf2c9764024463267ede3264860c0a87e2f2f23cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f302f04cf38b260f92cc93a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f644fd69b30a6602742c2323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:892b386f19688f64afa8c7f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每户人家都要有一个小真娃娃。\r\n训练员家里则要有两个以上，\r\n库存也拜托你一起管理啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c872aeb4ec47695b04800117b94210c2f4b1ec2b4baaf9fa1f6feb09ccd892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2eb9e54a231f59a5ba5701",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要出问题了。昨天的小真\r\n跟今天的小真，有哪里不一样？\r\n答案就在你的心里喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e2b9642fd54aa906576731082bd2757fbb5756d4eb880f91c1f878c4164bfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b30434afdf242057cc13a38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "镜饼～软绵绵的镜饼。\r\n小真的脸颊也一样软绵绵，\r\n请摸摸看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f2096f9fc18248b8a83e3602abd64b26f0e896c7df2c51234027da42d4a0b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9edb9c5d7bcf7bd2e5754156",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员有送友情巧克力给别人吗？\r\n或者你打算送真心巧克力……\r\n哎呀，我还是先不要问好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e98af6958550afeaab50fa9ee1f476108f0693fdcc55130719620fc1fbf352a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae6cd45fd654a86e0cf48830",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "话说我今天准备了\r\n限定一人份的糖渍栗子。\r\n……你会讨厌吃甜食吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c575887fc1fba5a94bca4dfb98cae71f2ea5dc1ba3fb6e634e7b649be4bb564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16b56e1929137333cf5f952b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直有某个人想要与自己相见。\r\n织女和牛郎真是幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86926782f7ff3fbe004ff8749b0b0b65805af1b9abf996792ad258ea52409b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62ee4a406758a7ac6aff8f47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请告诉所有你认识的人，\r\n要变装的话推荐扮成小真喔，\r\n只要戴上王冠就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c682bd8b18f7b48e6e74d50a1bb12fd35e1e3c659e850634714d01237e413d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:840ca0dc4755155e8979dbde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在大大的圣诞树下展露微笑的小真\r\n也非常可爱喔。\r\n所以说，要跟我一起出门吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4efc0d2af087ed007ce49f8b7e3be2b87391921d20c3588af4b84b33dcf19b59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fd29ef6a51cd8578983f187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前给圣诞老人添过一次麻烦，\r\n因为收到的礼物不是我想要的……\r\n当时的我是个任性的孩子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02635e3f8b06dc2dbc1ecb19e59117af9fbbc196cc7cb25f310359aac3eca83d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9d1d67d43b1f8bae2d12715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了。耶～",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e2c78296cf319c07113f6c32a700afeffd147e8dcb589a73caa36ec828845e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:572c8fc6a525691093c3b888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也一转眼就要结束了。\r\n想做的事情都做完了吗？\r\n小真还有很多事情没做呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7188f7fa9a3575e3018095ddc3056473b77a62396a289478b8f6c202c2ca8aa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3385b32fbc59b08efbe4a745",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。顺利度过一年\r\n看似容易，实则弥足珍贵。\r\n明年也要让我替你庆生喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8eb0a6fff98c76ae4e229285d1461cf912664e7b99a365a76e0674879961010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed70ced2790f6829cf746510",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用来庆祝生日的花，我等等会做成\r\n干燥花。无论是明天或后天，\r\n都要继续欣赏它喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6f2a1055aa8859c4ed90afadd595171ead2855b3214e8465cc526c675c392a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1911a22d9087447748754552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真难得生日，\r\n请帮我大肆庆祝一番。\r\n要让我获得许多幸福喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2c13e45d4e60b2bbc0035c704fa096a62caece77796d13a9718b74760b73f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9935be7866d1987fc3e9bc71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺便问一下，\r\n过了几岁，才能被训练员\r\n当成大人看待呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "100feed1dbee2f4b6bf346057240d88536159119d765b979374b2d5d98a57ec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6239efa981af246651dffa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到新公告了。\r\n如果五秒以内没看就会「砰！」……\r\n应该不至于做到这种程度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2621ac6edb7696f61269076dca3dc2c76faa2c1614cb463ae29863aa6635a3bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d1c389b99b142d74ffced6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，好像有礼物送到了。\r\n有寄给小真的粉丝信吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a46e58521c18a55a18b0c5fc6c230a4c209cd7c3124fe157fbd9fb150cbd2006",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d2e36bac0a902cc836e5dfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，好像有已经达成的任务。\r\n去领取奖励吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d599ed9a57986a532893af401f29ecb3ea39398bd8c886d2e65ddd4c96a5a53a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1313d643f249f034a3b348df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。是新活动的通知……\r\n哔哔！小真调查队集合！\r\n请提供详细的报告！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9364c4cb359011ab4fe30cbb0b4faac4e6dc24efb7e38096e3e7fe69c1d62c4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6267345efc7168cbebffa83f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……活动开始了。\r\n只要趁现在查看，\r\n就能掌握下一波流行的灵感……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "059589f6bcacfed8a3139a65e9b70cd87cd6f66b742ec10c288e2e3c5873b889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76bfc4fae3911b023cc9c4e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……输掉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b82a05b3e4ac50cdf500abe7a02126d7e2f95d476c1d7adb42772a2b76737d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db1446aa1afce36c4927938c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级好像提升了。\r\n为了进行市场调查，\r\n须要去确认一下信息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "264c4be0a990faf9681c09ef334b9ea92d953455a2c3fe12169d04340746eb28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ffda2812f8a1e7d8c63ed93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天会变成\r\n超级有名的小真。\r\n这种程度的换装易如反掌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f821409b7a3d787daea15fb63a33166c0806b950fd98d2514d681bab707bf2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:befedfd58e3e5ee7398f3bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伏特加看到这身打扮后说\r\n我看起来很聪明……\r\n……小真，本来就很聪明哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d429de2a406a33b61530468500c0555a630616a07ecd00387172d303b599f9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfe6a955cd61c09bd5d8aeef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。\r\n下次要和赤骥换什么样的衣服呢？\r\n就选一件蓬蓬又可爱的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63e54941607b08b4831e3fffed79e53c229b92b697f8e368ffe9981c311b640d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bbba7570101dd8039c4dd68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现得还算可以。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a972165abbef3b9ea56ac9236fb73275dd9c70536d542071b3d09f63a899a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2fe3b8c01e23ea014676465",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵，我赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc55d1350dc9410fb10932c49e70b464b3edc784db12c297b8ca630eee56e828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad6beff3c6fec3a1e7f43534",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……输掉了。",
