      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99bef97b62668be2b961cff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这个症状是……脚的疲劳还没\r\n恢复……如果继续跑下去一定会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf7b5b8bad0a5c9378199360634090e388fdfdb792b9b12d9816964b50c23a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b13c127ddf6246dacee3db6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真警报启动！\r\n小真已经陷入「疲惫」。\r\n听懂了吗？是「疲惫」喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "383d07ccad2e8171ce4bf2b89a9697e7ea367465693448893408c39cce2de129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a889bfd5bbde13d9f002787f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，快让我接受训练吧。\r\n我会把所有训练\r\n一个一个解决给你看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4c2dc910420140eb86c38c70d115390f1b37f2855b704e894bcd67552d4f4b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb5a3fd8f7f5f4562a2a428d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你见识一下，\r\n小真比昨天更加进步的实力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f43645f1946a0af1165202ec594c5e4e9fb8033626cb3142c985f3c98cbded3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
